; mode 3 -> fault_csrbuf_invalid.
inject at 0 csr 0x50=3
run until main.faulted max 5000
expect_fault main fault_csrbuf_invalid
; clearing the fault retries the SAME instruction: without fixing the cause it faults again
inject in 1 fault_clear main
run 20
expect_fault main fault_csrbuf_invalid :: still the same fault (change the environment / profile, or edit the program, then restart)
